  "log": [
   "The holding pen smells of coolant and fear. Beyond the gate: a bowl of packed slag and chain-link, and ten thousand people who paid to watch steel die.",
   "Pipsqueak Odo revs a patched Salt Skiff two stalls down. He doesn't look at you — rookies never do. \"Nothing personal,\" he mutters to his wheel. \"I just gotta eat.\"",
   "The pit master drops his arm.",
   "Nobody chants for you. Somebody near the gate is taking bets on how long you last — the long odds are unkind.",
   "Round 1: you have the initiative.",
   "The Vulture's Slugthrower hits — 6 through the B — a tire is shredded!",
   "Odo's voice cracks over the din: \"Okay. Okay okay okay—\"",
   "Round 2: Pipsqueak Odo has the jump.",
   "\"Fresh meat's still rolling!\" someone shouts, halfway between mockery and surprise.",
   "Round 3: Pipsqueak Odo has the jump."
  ]
 },
 "log": [
  "Day 1: Wrench shift at the garage. Paid 66 scrap.",
  "Somebody's goat is loose in the scrap lanes again. The militia sergeant chasing it pretends not to see you seeing him.",
  "Day 2: Wall guard rotation. Paid 58 scrap.",
  "Day 3: Salvage sorting. Paid 50 scrap.",
  "A gate guard squints at your rig, then at you. \"Towing fees are up front, friend.\"",
  "Bought a Courser. The yard hands you the keys and a shrug. She's yours: The Vulture.",
  "Slag Bar: \"They say the Collection's flagship is a refinery on treads. They say you hear it before the horizon shows it.\""
 ]
